theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
text = "	Everything changed from the moment a deal was struck with The Council and The Corruption. And with tyranny and greed running rampant, disrupting the once peaceful balance of the world, you can�t just let it continue. The life you once knew, gone with just a snap of someone�s hands.
	No, you will not stand for something so frivolous. And although you are powerless now, your courage will lead your heart where it needs to go. 
"

